    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of the Shell: Prologue is the free version of Day of the Shell. It is a fast-paced tactical roguelite, where each turn is played in a single click. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have brought down their wrath on humanity, and only a few remote islands remain. A lonely monster huntress has risen to challenge and appease the gods, traveling through what's left of the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 world, 13 islands to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 weapons: revolver and crossbow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 blessings and 12 relics to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 runes to permanently improve the Huntress\u2019s passive skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique enemies</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of the Shell: Prologue is the free version of Day of the Shell. It is a fast-paced tactical roguelite, where each turn is played in a single click. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have brought down their wrath on humanity, and only a few remote islands remain. A lonely monster huntress has risen to challenge and appease the gods, traveling through what's left of the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 world, 13 islands to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 weapons: revolver and crossbow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 blessings and 12 relics to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 runes to permanently improve the Huntress\u2019s passive skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique enemies</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Day of the Shell: Prologue is a \u201cone-click, one-turn\u201d tactical rogue-lite. In a shattered and flooded world, travel from island to island with only hope and a revolver, challenging and appeasing the gods.",
